\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({y}_{j}+{y}_{j-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j},$ where $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1}.$" 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1075 17592186284929 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1075 17592186286338 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1075 17592186286556 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1075 17592186286990 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1075 17592186525220 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186287264 1075 17592186525238 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186287264 1075 17592186525370 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186287264 1075 17592186525767 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186287264 1078 17592186286990 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186287264 1078 17592186525220 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186314045 1075 17592186525833 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186314045 1078 17592186312275 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186314045 1078 17592186525833 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186314550 1075 17592186525705 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186314550 1078 17592186312439 13194139535680 17592186045417 false] [17592186314550 1078 17592186525705 13194139535680 17592186045417 true] [17592186314898 1074 "To differentiate a logarithm with base $a,$ we use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{a}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡a}.\n$$\n\nTo find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{3}+x-3{log}_{6}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3{x}^{2}+1-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡6} \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}+1-\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=3$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{a